WEBVTT

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.559
ili noćnoj mori nadgledanja?

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:31.851
Ne znam.

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:33.375
Mene zanima sadašnjost.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.309
I želim vam pokazati

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:40.309
kako nam prošlost može pomoći
razumjeti sadašnjost.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.976
Ništa bolje ne sumira

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.768
obećanje i opasnost djelotvornosti

00:00:45.792 --> 00:00:47.768
kao jedan običan krumpir.

00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:50.309
Krumpir potječe s Anda

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:55.476
i od drevnih Inka je stigao do Europe.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.250
Krumpir je vrhunsko djelo
balansirane ishrane.